  "solution": "For the quadratic equation  \n\\[\n18t^2 + 45t - 500 = 0,\n\\]\nthe product of the roots is given by Vieta’s formula:\n\\[\n\\text{product of roots} = \\frac{c}{a},\n\\]\nwhere \\(a=18\\), \\(b=45\\), and \\(c=-500\\).\n\nSo,\n\\[\n\\frac{c}{a} = \\frac{-500}{18} = -\\frac{250}{9}.\n\\]\n\nThe answer is \\(-\\frac{250}{9}\\).",
